; AlifeTactics faction Personality - the per-action chance a faction takes an action (0..1), rolled AFTER the Intelligence
; gate passes. Paired with gamedata/scripts/at_faction.script (check_personality). Section = action, key = faction, value =
; the chance; a default key covers factions the section does not list, and an action with no section here is universal (1.0).
; Final rate = Intelligence (0.40-0.70 by rank) x Personality, so a 1.0 action fires on 40-70% of its openings, a 0.15 on 6-10%, a 0 never.
; The values ARE each faction's combat doctrine - who routs, who holds, who presses, who finishes a downed enemy - grounded in
; GSC's character-type (характер) and creature rating design [8]. Zombied never participate, a universal rule in at_faction.script.

